    <!-- Warning box — Plan.md §7.4, verbatim intent of design.md §12 -->
    <string name="tg_warning">Keys sent over Telegram are stored in that chat\'s history on Telegram\'s servers. InkDeck deletes the message the moment it is read, but use keys you can rotate — and push .pem files over USB instead.</string>

